<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT WASHINGTON MEN'S TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT WASHINGTON MEN'S TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on Saturday at the</p>
<p>$675,000 Legg Mason Tennis Classic (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Semi-Finals</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat 11-Brett Steven (New Zealand) 6-2</p>
<p>7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>2-Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat David Wheaton (U.S.) 6-2</p>
<p>6-3</p>
</text>
